WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.367
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:03.834
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:05.300
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.234
President Biden
and First Lady Dr. Jill Biden

00:00:08.234 --> 00:00:11.334
hosted a Halloween event
on Monday at the White House

00:00:11.334 --> 00:00:13.868
which featured
a "Hallo-READ" theme

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:15.200
where children received books.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.934
Meanwhile, at Mar-a-Lago,
former president Trump

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:20.868
also gave trick-or-treaters
some reading material.

00:00:20.868 --> 00:00:24.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.400
President Biden hosted
a Halloween trick-or-treat event

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.868
on Monday at the White House,

00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:31.834
and it was going pretty great
until Commander ate a Minion.

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:33.968
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.334 --> 00:00:39.167
"Bit a Minion" probably
would've been better,

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:41.467
'cause now the joke
is he ate a kid.

00:00:41.467 --> 00:00:44.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:47.334
President Biden reportedly
became increasingly concerned

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:48.834
about artificial intelligence

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:51.133
after watching the new
"Mission: Impossible" movie.

00:00:51.133 --> 00:00:53.767
And he must have done
a movie marathon,

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:56.300
because tomorrow night
he's giving a prime-time address

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:59.501
about sandworms.

00:00:59.501 --> 00:01:04.367
[ As Biden ] They're real big,
folks, and they're real hungry.

00:01:04.367 --> 00:01:06.400
[ Normal voice ] Ahead of
Donald Trump Jr.'s testimony

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.200
in the Trump Organization's
ongoing civil fraud trial,

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.167
former president Trump
attacked the judge

00:01:11.167 --> 00:01:13.968
in an early-morning post
today on Truth Social

00:01:13.968 --> 00:01:16.367
and warned him to
"leave my children alone,"

00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:18.934
adding, "you know, like I did."

00:01:18.934 --> 00:01:21.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.601 --> 00:01:24.667
President Biden traveled today
to a family farm in Minnesota.

00:01:24.667 --> 00:01:28.968
Said Kamala Harris,
"Go on, boy, you're free.

00:01:28.968 --> 00:01:30.667
Get. Go on."

00:01:30.667 --> 00:01:32.767
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:01:32.767 --> 00:01:35.100
Republican presidential
hopeful Chris Christie

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:36.200
said in a new interview

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:37.701
that former White House
chief of staff

00:01:37.701 --> 00:01:41.133
Mark Meadows's immunity deal
with federal prosecutors

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:43.567
means former president Trump
is going to be convicted

00:01:43.567 --> 00:01:45.367
and added, "It's over."

00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:48.133
And I take his word for it
because historically,

00:01:48.133 --> 00:01:50.133
it takes Chris Christie
a long time

00:01:50.133 --> 00:01:52.167
to admit when something's over.

00:01:52.167 --> 00:01:53.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:55.334
In a new podcast interview,

00:01:55.334 --> 00:01:57.367
Florida governor Ron DeSantis
was asked

00:01:57.367 --> 00:02:01.067
if the cowboy boots he is often
photographed wearing have heels,

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:03.467
and he would have walked
straight out of that interview

00:02:03.467 --> 00:02:05.868
if his arches
weren't killing him.

00:02:05.868 --> 00:02:07.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.934 --> 00:02:10.367
The last operating prison ship
in the country

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:11.734
is set to close this week.

00:02:11.734 --> 00:02:14.067
Well, you had a good run.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:16.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.868 --> 00:02:21.734
The USDA today began

00:02:21.734 --> 00:02:24.300
a raccoon vaccination campaign
in Nebraska,

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:27.601
except for one who's
doing his own research.

00:02:27.601 --> 00:02:29.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.868 --> 00:02:40.367
Why is it on a football field?

00:02:40.367 --> 00:02:42.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.033 --> 00:02:46.834
And finally,
authorities in Florida

00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:49.033
have warned residents
about a white truck

00:02:49.033 --> 00:02:51.067
impersonating
a law-enforcement vehicle

00:02:51.067 --> 00:02:54.367
that has a decal
that says "Booty Patrol."

00:02:54.367 --> 00:02:58.400
But don't worry.
The FBI is investigating.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:01.133
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

